{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0NpdGFkZWwlMjBEaWFuYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Citadel Diana","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pXfgTz0uYUfYVEiJ0gRra6tKoAp.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xsKGPcEnwTPI2CS3OrBVIEUzi1E.jpg","description":"Milan, 2030: Diana Cavalieri is a double agent for the secret syndicate Citadel, who infiltrated Manticore, the rival agency that destroyed Citadel eight years ago. Trapped behind enemy lines, Diana has a chance to leave the agency forever, but she has to decide whether to trust a surprising ally: the heir of Manticore Italy, Edo Zani.\n\nRated TV-14 · Canceled · First aired 10 Oct 2024 · Italy, United States of America · Language: Italian\nStudio: Cattleya, AGBO, Midnight Radio · Network: Prime Video\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6\n\nOn your server — Audio: Italian","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Action & Adventure","Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0NpdGFkZWwlMjBEaWFuYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.1","title":"Split in Two","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"2030: in a gray and hyper-controlled Milan, Diana and Luca are sent on a mission to Lugano to spy on the exchange of a powerful weapon. Not far away, Edo Zani, Manticore Italy's heir, has to respond to an unexpected proposal from the head of Manticore France, Cecile. In the flashbacks, Diana investigates her parents' suspicious deaths when she meets Gabriele, a mysterious Citadel agent.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fQZz58bKGWr7gh37G6gIljcvwyb.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0NpdGFkZWwlMjBEaWFuYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.2","title":"War","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Diana and Edo form a secret agreement and make their first move, but they underestimate Cecile's fierce reaction. While Manticore Italy is under attack, Ettore Zani has to step in to stop a war from breaking out. In the flashbacks, Diana completes her training with Gabriele and becomes a Citadel agent.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9gFXm9OKSERnpnvQQa55xYPMooX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0NpdGFkZWwlMjBEaWFuYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.3","title":"Together","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Ettore sends Edo and Diana to Sicily on a sensitive mission that threatens their alliance. However, under the Mediterranean sun, the two discover they are connected by much more than their objectives. Eight years earlier, Diana infiltrates Manticore and carries out her first mission.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vXjQuftUlWfbDpqDhuAnxkoeE6I.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0NpdGFkZWwlMjBEaWFuYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.4","title":"The Zanis","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Diana is captured and struggles desperately to survive while Ettore has to make a hard decision in order to restore Manticore Italy's power, as memories resurface of the day when his relationship with Edo was shattered forever.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pqdcBZV6FYqTZd9J3es83rILLbi.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0NpdGFkZWwlMjBEaWFuYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.5","title":"Attack","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Edo leads a group of agents in an attack on the Manticore France's headquarters in Paris. Just as Diana is about to get her hands on the weapon, she is forced to decide which side she is on, as she had to do eight years earlier, the night Citadel was destroyed.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jwh16a10blfYTkXjgTPYcHDjYyN.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0NpdGFkZWwlMjBEaWFuYSUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.6","title":"Jupiter","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Diana ponders her choice, Edo works on a powerful new weapon. Ettore tries to get closer to his son, playing one last, surprise card. In a flashback, the Zanis mourn Enrico while Diana realizes she's the last living Citadel agent.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/51N91s7MQ4ZImtCTeJJMEsw1H3P.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"6.8","cast":["Matilda De Angelis","Lorenzo Cervasio","Maurizio Lombardi","Julia Piaton","Thekla Reuten","Giordana Faggiano","Daniele Paoloni","Jun Ichikawa"],"director":["Alessandro Fabbri"],"released":"2024-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"This shadow war has many players.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Alessandro Fabbri","character":"Director"},{"name":"Matilda De Angelis","character":"Diana Cavalieri","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ofCQCcJVHXS934jphfvzmORlhS.jpg"},{"name":"Lorenzo Cervasio","character":"Edoardo 'Edo' Zani","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ae3yyTIFwXJLYH1bOpprhZ1G48B.jpg"},{"name":"Maurizio Lombardi","character":"Ettore Zani","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4l11pikTOITlsayYCOtAl939Uz6.jpg"},{"name":"Julia Piaton","character":"Cécile Martin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/10QGSeZaq121UJgOizGFcW0SRku.jpg"},{"name":"Thekla Reuten","character":"Julia Zani","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/grsIJAo7a37SAVl3La5aaUFpVla.jpg"},{"name":"Giordana Faggiano","character":"Sara Cavalieri","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4iGmL1AvsEGYC8AS3PLJldtgGdc.jpg"},{"name":"Daniele Paoloni","character":"Matteo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oAFuRMTsULDp6yjj16HC7TJxYQG.jpg"},{"name":"Jun Ichikawa","character":"Giada","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/14I8xU8EbFstCKaxZ43fr7iLa6L.jpg"},{"name":"Filippo Nigro","character":"Gabriele Donati","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/84QswEDfCsGB6hbaOHn68GhkR3S.jpg"}]},"trailer